<title>USA: Rockwell Intl Corp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Rockwell Intl Corp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>SEAL BEACH, Calif. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dec. 31, 1996     Q1     Dec. 31, 1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.82		    $0.89</p>
<p> Net			179,000		  192,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,608,000		2,385,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     218,700		  217,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1995 includes $40 million, or $0.19/shr, of income from discontinued operations.  Excluding that figure, Q1 1995 net income was $152 million, or $0.70/shr.</p>
</text>
